## The other files

* [`PROFILE-IMAGE.md`](PROFILE-IMAGE.md) — profile 2, `image/1`. The smallest
  useful werk: a source image, its derived sizes as in-file versions, a
  recipe, a disclosure, semantics, a signature chain. Same twelve laws.
